          Workshop on Generative AI for E-Commerce <br />(2025)

        
      </h1>
      
        <p class="page__lead">September 22 <br /> Prague, Czech Republic <br /> Held in conjunction with <a href="https://recsys.acm.org/recsys25/">RecSys 2025</a>
